        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schroon%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Scaroon Manor, now a state campground, was the filming location for the 1957 Warner Brothers movie Marjorie Morningstar.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
